    "diagnostic_scope": "The English matrix examined all 649 frames and 30 exact saves, found 10 pixel mismatches, and correctly exited failed. All mismatched pixels were confined to the top-bar deck icon, x=257..275, y=3..18.",
    "cause": "Static top-bar motion outlived an App reconstructed at the same address with a reset Content generation. Native controlled cases reused this address; independent WASM instances started with cleared static storage.",
    "runtime_fix": "Both App::init overloads explicitly reset the top-bar motion. Dedicated regressions cover memory and ranged ResourceSource initialization after real in-place reconstruction.",
    "acceptance": "The ordinary unchanged backend checker then passed every frame and save in both language matrices. No pixel tolerance, save tolerance, or test-driver-only cache reset was introduced."
  },
